      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "With the latest release of Jena 3.1.1 (Fuseki 2.4.1), there is now support for an embedded Fuseki2 server. See ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://jena.apache.org/documentation/fuseki2/fuseki-embedded.html"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://jena.apache.org/documentation/fuseki2/fuseki-embedded.html",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Rather than simply stop using the EmbeddedFusekiServer (i.e. v.1), the integration tests should be updated to use the ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "em"
           }
          ],
          "text": "latest",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " FusekiEmbeddedServer (i.e. v.2). ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
