     "body": "<p>With the latest release of Jena 3.1.1 (Fuseki 2.4.1), there is now support for an embedded Fuseki2 server. See <a href=\"http://jena.apache.org/documentation/fuseki2/fuseki-embedded.html\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://jena.apache.org/documentation/fuseki2/fuseki-embedded.html</a></p>\n\n<p>Rather than simply stop using the EmbeddedFusekiServer (i.e. v.1), the integration tests should be updated to use the <em>latest</em> FusekiEmbeddedServer (i.e. v.2). </p>",
     "created": "12/Nov/16 10:45 AM",
