  "description": "<p>From <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" data-account-id=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" accountid=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" rel=\"noreferrer\">A. Soroka</a>: See here (<a href=\"https://github.com/ocymum/trippi-sparql-update/blob/master/pom.xml\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/ocymum/trippi-sparql-update/blob/master/pom.xml</a>) for an example of how to use Fuseki 2 to support integration tests with the Maven plugin for Cargo.</p>\n\n<p>More background here: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/pull/50#issuecomment-134578075\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/pull/50#issuecomment-134578075</a></p>",
